        "name": "── ส่วน C: Modbus TCP Client (ต้องติดตั้ง node-red-contrib-modbus และมี PLC จริง) ──",
        "info": "วิธีติดตั้ง:\n1. Menu ≡ → Manage Palette → Install\n2. ค้นหา: node-red-contrib-modbus\n3. Install แล้ว Restart\n\nRegister Map (Mitsubishi D-Register):\n  D0 = Active Power   [W * 10]   e.g. 35000 = 3500.0 W\n  D1 = Voltage        [V * 10]   e.g.  2200 = 220.0 V\n  D2 = Current        [A * 100]  e.g.  1590 = 15.90 A\n  D3 = Frequency      [Hz* 100]  e.g.  5000 = 50.00 Hz\n\nFCODE 3 = Read Holding Registers (FC03)",
        "x": 310,
        "y": 940,
        "wires": []
    },
